{"id":"vod_sn_38882","vodId":"38882","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"阴守忍者","name_cn":"阴守忍者","date":"2006-01-01","year":"2006","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/8b659a9f48661a1af182af148ae22dcb.jpg"},"summary":"阴守护（私市淳 配音）出身于历史悠久的忍者世家，外表看起来呆头呆脑的他自然也继承了流传在家族血液之中的忍术。阴守护家世世代代都肩负着保护绀若家的责任，而阴守护要保护的，是绀若家的大小姐绀若优奈（中原麻衣 配音）。实际上，阴守护一直都非常真挚的喜欢着优奈，可是，家族传统让他只能够将这份心意深深的埋藏在心底。　　阴守护和优奈就读于同一所学校之中，在这里，他们结识了很多有趣的朋友们——含着金汤匙出生的千金大小姐沢菓爱里（新谷良子 配音）、一心想要杀掉优奈但渐渐被阴守护所吸引的剑客真双津椿（小岛幸子 配音），会有怎样好玩的故事发生在这里呢？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:05:27","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/XNDiczxLdy1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/xzduq8nXVG1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/HKknV1cv8B1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/YWdS09RDSQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/dyReY8MVF21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/88vLTLukMs1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/pMxQBNVVT21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/M4x2YbGehd1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/fFBE9tpLuz1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Wz1Xr8iJUb1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qmDzNYyTS11/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/pXLhHJz6hz1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:53.514Z"}